{"name":"Moondust","hex":"#b39786","fetched":"2026-10-24","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"moondust","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The fine regolith found on the surface of the Moon."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/moondust"}],"entries":[{"title":"Moondust (video game)","blocks":[{"text":"Moondust is a 1983 generative music video game created for the Commodore 64 by virtual reality pioneer, Jaron Lanier. Moondust was programmed in 6502 assembly in 1982, and is considered the first art video game. Moondust has frequently been used as an art installation piece in museum exhibitions from Corcoran Gallery of Art's 1983 \"ARTcade\" to the Smithsonian's 2012 \"The Art of Video Games\". It has also been used by Lanier and others in papers and lectures as an example to demonstrate the unexpected ephemerality of digital data."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/4a/Moondust_box.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moondust_(video_game)","wikidata":"Q6907718"},{"title":"Moondust (album)","blocks":[{"text":"MOONDUST is the nineteenth studio album by Japanese alternative rock band The Pillows. It was released on October 22, 2014, and marks the band's 25th anniversary."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/ed/Pillows_Moondust.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Moondust_(album)","wikidata":"Q18391132"},{"title":"Lunar regolith","blocks":[{"text":"Lunar regolith is the unconsolidated material found on the surface of the Moon and in the Moon's tenuous atmosphere. Lunar soil typically refers to only the finer fraction of lunar regolith, which is composed of grains 1 cm in diameter or less, but is often used interchangeably. Lunar soil differs substantially in properties from terrestrial soil. Lunar dust is even finer regolith than lunar soil, with grain sizes less than one millimeter."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Buzz_Aldrin%27s_bootprint_on_the_Moon%2C_AS11-40-5877.jpg/330px-Buzz_Aldrin%27s_bootprint_on_the_Moon%2C_AS11-40-5877.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lunar_regolith","wikidata":"Q1037499"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/4a/Moondust_box.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/4a/Moondust_box.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMoondust_box.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/7e/Moon_dust_01.gif/250px-Moon_dust_01.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/7/7e/Moon_dust_01.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/7e/Moon_dust_01.gif/250px-Moon_dust_01.gif?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Screenshot of gameplay","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMoon_dust_01.gif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/ed/Pillows_Moondust.jpg/250px-Pillows_Moondust.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/ed/Pillows_Moondust.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/ed/Pillows_Moondust.jpg/250px-Pillows_Moondust.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APillows_Moondust.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commo